[{"id":2499880169,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6VASTp","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think this is, generally, a great idea, and _pretty unlikely_ to cause performance regressions. Linked lists are [rarely useful](https://xkcd.com/2483/). In fact, I would advocate to [rename `List` to `LinkedList`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100323) to avoid accidental use (e.g. by Java folks) because it is rarely more efficient than a linear `LocalVector`. `LocalVector` should be the go-to default, and the use of `LinkedList` should be well-proven to be faster than `LocalVector` in each specific case, documented next to the variable to justify its use.\r\n\r\nThat being said — this is a pretty big change, and I gotta say if I were the code maintainer I would be uncomfortable to merge it because of potential regressions. I would therefore advocate to split the PR and address each use separately, to make them small, comfortable and somewhat tested chunks. It's annoying, but it's safe.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"